pi-agent-core also depends on @earendil-works/pi-schema 1.5.2 from
the same repository and license. pi-ai brings @earendil-works/pi-telemetry
1.5.2 transitively, plus provider SDKs, including openai 7.19.0,
@anthropic-ai/sdk, @google/genai, and @aws-sdk/client-bedrock-runtime.
November's adapter uses pi-ai's OpenAI-completions transport, which calls
the openai client; the other provider SDKs ship unused. Their own licenses
remain in the published packages and must be kept when November packages a
release (#24). Their install scripts are not enabled.
